### Runtime rule storage ###
# The live, editable model and its version history. Written by the service at runtime and
# seeded from src/main/resources/PromotionCompatibility.dmn when absent, so it is a working
# directory rather than source. To promote a GUI edit, copy the model back over the one in
# src/main/resources and rebuild.
dmn-storage/
